cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Single Tree High-Density Photogrammetry Dataset"
abstract: >-
  812 full-resolution geotagged photographs (14.1 GB) of a single mature deciduous tree in
  Minnetonka, Minnesota, captured 18 and 20 July 2020 with a DJI Mavic 2 Pro
  (Hasselblad L1D-20c). Includes low- and mid-altitude hover passes at 0.5 m and 1.7 m with
  upward gimbal angle covering trunk, root flare and canopy underside. 807 of 812 images align.
authors:
  - family-names: Guertin
    given-names: Matthew
    website: "https://mattguertin.com"
date-released: 2020-07-20
version: "1.0.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
